cted hear, search, pursue and overwhelm the player. The infected are no longer simply given perfect knowledge of the player. Gunfire, explosions a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T11:58:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706684418","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760840-1844115010492958","game_id":"steam-3760840","kind":"update","title":"BLOODSTATE Demo Update #3 – Performance, AI & Combat Improvements","summary":"BLOODSTATE — PERFORMANCE, AI AND COMBAT UPDATE Thank you to everyone continuing to play the BLOODSTATE demo and share feedback. This update contains a broad range of improvements across performance, loading, enemy spawning, zombie behaviour, animation, audio, controls, weapon handling, damage reactions, ragdolls and corpse cleanup. Much of this work focused on making large encounters run more smoothly without sacrificing the atmosphere, movement or responsiveness of the infected. PERFORMANCE AND","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T18:20:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010492958","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760840-1842846814452788","game_id":"steam-3760840","kind":"update","title":"BLOODSTATE Demo Update #2 – Gameplay, AI, UI & Stability Improvements","summary":"FIXES AND IMPROVEMENTSThank you to everyone continuing to play the BLOODSTATE demo and share feedback. This update improves weapons, inventory management, zombie combat, loot crates, menus, environmental interactions and the opening sequence.WEAPONSAdded side aiming to compatible weapons.Improved side-aim positioning across individual weapons, including assault rifles and the MP5.Fixed the camera incorrectly zooming out while side aiming.Improved camera transitions between standard aiming and si","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T10:46:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814452788","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3760840-1842846814445428","game_id":"steam-3760840","kind":"update","title":"BLOODSTATE Demo Update #1 – Gameplay, AI & Stability Improvements","summary":"FIXES AND IMPROVEMENTSThank you to everyone who has played the BLOODSTATE demo and shared feedback. This first update addresses many of the issues reported since the demo launched.PLAYER AND CAMERAFixed several clipping issues around walls and tight indoor areas.Fixed an issue near the sofa that allowed the player to clip through the stairs or upper floor.Increased jump gravity to prevent players from reaching unintended areas.Improved jump and grounded-state recovery to reduce animation lockups","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T05:46:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445428","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3760840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:28Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:27Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3760840":"2026-10-26T00:45:28Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3760840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:27Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:27Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5143720":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3760840","app_id":376